            </Buff>
            <Buff>
              <Type>Linguistics 10%</Type>
            </Buff>
          </Necklace>
          <Trinket>
            <Name>Enchanted Chocolates by Fabiano &amp;amp; Zelda</Name>
            <Icon>Trinket_73</Icon>
            <Description>This small decorative box contains four types of delicious chocolate candies.
Each type not only has its own unique flavor but also conveys a helpful enchantment.</Description>
            <DropLocation>DDO Store, Seasonal Items</DropLocation>
            <MinLevel>1</MinLevel>
            <EquipmentSlot>
              <Trinket/>
            </EquipmentSlot>
            <Material>Category:No Material items</Material>
          </Trinket>
          <Cloak>
            <Name>Shimmer</Name>
            <Icon>Cloak_4</Icon>
            <Description>The magical threads woven into this cloak were designed to be attractive to
others. Even in pitch darkness, the cloak lures passersby like a siren's song.</Description>
            <DropLocation>Third Time's a Charm, End Chest</DropLocation>
            <MinLevel>15</MinLevel>
            <EquipmentSlot>
              <Cloak/>
            </EquipmentSlot>
            <Material>Cloth</Material>
            <Buff>
              <Type>SchoolFocusNumber</Type>
              <Value1>2</Value1>
              <BonusType>Insightful</BonusType>
              <Description1>Enchantment</Description1>
              <Item>Enchantment</Item>
            </Buff>
            <Buff>
              <Type>SchoolFocusNumber</Type>
              <Value1>1</Value1>
              <BonusType>Quality</BonusType>
              <Description1>Enchantment</Description1>
              <Item>Enchantment</Item>
            </Buff>
            <Buff>
              <Type>SpellPenetration</Type>
              <Value1>5</Value1>
              <BonusType>Equipment</BonusType>
            </Buff>
            <Buff>
              <Type>AbilityBonus</Type>
              <Value1>8</Value1>
              <BonusType>Enhancement</BonusType>
              <Description1>Charisma</Description1>
              <Item>Charisma</Item>
            </Buff>
          </Cloak>
          <Belt>
            <Name>Belt of the Seven Ideals (Level 12)</Name>
            <Icon>Belt_9</Icon>
            <Description>This gaudy belt is adorned with seven faceted stones that span every color of
the rainbow. Surely they have magical as well as aesthetic properties.</Description>
            <DropLocation>Gianthold Tor, Black Dragon chest (Heroic Normal)</DropLocation>
            <MinLevel>12</MinLevel>
            <EquipmentSlot>
              <Belt/>
            </EquipmentSlot>
            <Material>Leather</Material>
            <Buff>
              <Type>Potency</Type>
              <Value1>44</Value1>
              <BonusType>Equipment</BonusType>
            </Buff>
            <Buff>
              <Type>SpellPenetrationNumeral</Type>
              <Value1>2</Value1>
              <BonusType>Equipment</BonusType>
              <Description1>II</Description1>
            </Buff>
          </Belt>
          <Goggles>
            <Name>Dream Visor (Level 12)</Name>
            <Icon>Goggles_12a</Icon>
            <Description>The world as seen through this visor is a very strange place. People and things
are distorted and almost ethereal. Things that were previously hidden are now
